{"seq":2,"slug":"testing-with-flags","title":"带开关的测试策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/practice/testing-with-flags","wordCount":1351,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"带开关的测试策略\">带开关的测试策略</h1><p>每加一个布尔开关，代码里就多出一条「另一种执行路径」。两个开关有四种组合，十个开关理论上有 1024 种。如果天真地认为「每种组合都要测」，测试矩阵会在开关数面前指数爆炸，CI 跑到天荒地老。这一篇直面这个组合爆炸：哪些组合真的要测、怎样把开关从单元测试里隔离出去、CI 里到底跑哪个变体、以及开关如何反过来成为测试本身的工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-组合爆炸与它的边界\">核心概念：组合爆炸与它的边界</h2><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个独立布尔开关的状态空间是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。但「状态空间大」不等于「要测这么多」——绝大多数组合在生产里永远不会同时出现，而且大多数开关之间根本不交互。测试策略的全部艺术，是把「理论上的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>」收缩到「实际有风险的一小撮」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[n 个开关 理论 2^n 组合] --&gt; B{开关之间是否交互}&#10;  B --&gt;|大多数: 不交互| C[各自独立测&lt;br/&gt;线性 2n 个用例]&#10;  B --&gt;|少数: 有交互| D[只测有交互的组合]&#10;  A --&gt; E[CI 默认跑的基线组合]&#10;  E --&gt; F[即将上线的变体 = ON]&#10;  E --&gt; G[当前生产态 = 各开关现值]\">flowchart TD\n  A[n 个开关 理论 2^n 组合] --&gt; B{开关之间是否交互}\n  B --&gt;|大多数: 不交互| C[各自独立测&lt;br/&gt;线性 2n 个用例]\n  B --&gt;|少数: 有交互| D[只测有交互的组合]\n  A --&gt; E[CI 默认跑的基线组合]\n  E --&gt; F[即将上线的变体 = ON]\n  E --&gt; G[当前生产态 = 各开关现值]</pre><p>收缩的依据是：<strong>默认测两个点</strong>——「全部即将上线的新变体打开」（验证目标态）和「当前生产配置」（验证现状不被破坏）；<strong>额外只测真正会相互作用的开关组合</strong>。把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 降到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n + k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是少数有交互的组合数）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"哪些组合必须测\">哪些组合必须测</h2><p>判断一对开关要不要测它们的组合，看它们是否共享状态或控制同一段逻辑的不同侧面：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>开关关系</th>\n<th>是否需要测组合</th>\n<th>例子</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>完全独立（不同模块）</td>\n<td>否，各测各的</td>\n<td>新结算页 × 新搜索栏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同一功能的子开关</td>\n<td>是</td>\n<td>新编辑器 × 新编辑器的自动保存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一个依赖另一个</td>\n<td>是，且测「依赖关但被依赖开」的非法态</td>\n<td>高级导出依赖新仪表盘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>互斥</td>\n<td>是，确保不会同时为真</td>\n<td>旧布局 × 新布局</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>最危险的是「一个依赖另一个」却没人显式约束的情况——当被依赖的开关关着、依赖它的开关却开着时，会走到一条没人设计过的路径。这类组合必须有测试守住。</p>\n<h2 id=\"把开关从测试里隔离\">把开关从测试里隔离</h2><p>如果业务代码直接读全局开关状态，单元测试就会被「当前开关是什么」污染——同一个测试在开关开和关时结果不同，测试变得不确定。隔离的办法是<strong>让开关成为可注入的依赖</strong>，而不是从全局单例里硬读：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# 坏: 直接读全局, 测试无法控制&#10;def checkout(cart):&#10;    if global_flags.is_enabled(&quot;new-checkout&quot;):&#10;        ...&#10;&#10;# 好: 开关求值注入进来, 测试可任意指定&#10;def checkout(cart, flags: FlagClient):&#10;    if flags.is_enabled(&quot;new-checkout&quot;, cart.user):&#10;        ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 坏: 直接读全局, 测试无法控制</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> global_flags.is_enabled(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new-checkout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 好: 开关求值注入进来, 测试可任意指定</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> checkout</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(cart, flags: FlagClient):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> flags.is_enabled(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"new-checkout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, cart.user):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        ...</span></span></code></pre></div><p>测试里传入一个固定返回某变体的假 <code>FlagClient</code>，就能确定地测每一条分支。OpenFeature（见<a href=\"flag-system-architecture\">架构篇</a>）提供了内存 provider，专门用于测试时把评估结果写死成想要的值，这比手写 mock 更标准。核心原则和<a href=\"../foundations/flag-evaluation-model\">评估模型</a>一致：评估是纯函数，把输入（上下文、变体）控制住，输出就可预测。</p>\n<h2 id=\"ci-里跑哪个变体\">CI 里跑哪个变体</h2><p>CI 必须明确「用哪套开关配置跑测试」，否则会在「测了即将上线的功能」和「测了当前生产行为」之间随机漂移。务实的策略是分层：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>主流水线</strong>跑两套配置——「所有待发布开关 = ON」（确保新功能本身正确）和「当前生产配置」（确保没破坏现状）。</li>\n<li><strong>针对性组合</strong>只对前面识别出的有交互开关跑额外用例。</li>\n<li><strong>契约测试</strong>保证假 <code>FlagClient</code> 的行为和真实 SDK 一致，避免「mock 过了真实跑挂」。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这样既覆盖了真正的风险，又不会被 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 拖垮。</p>\n<h2 id=\"开关反过来是测试工具\">开关反过来是测试工具</h2><p>开关不只是被测试的对象，它本身能成为强大的测试与灰度手段，这是个常被忽略的双向关系：</p>\n<p><strong>合成监控指定变体</strong>。让生产环境的合成探测（synthetic check）通过专用上下文强制命中某个变体，就能在真实环境里持续验证「新路径」是否健康，而不影响真实用户——这是<a href=\"../delivery/progressive-rollout\">渐进放量</a>健康度信号的来源之一。</p>\n<p><strong>测试中开启暗启动（dark launch）</strong>。把新代码路径以「执行但不影响用户可见结果」的方式在生产跑起来（比如新算法和旧算法都算、只用旧的结果、对比两者），用开关控制这层影子流量。它让你在真实流量、真实数据规模下验证新实现，而风险为零。</p>\n<p><strong>生产环境调试开关</strong>。用开关控制详细日志、慢查询采样等诊断行为，出问题时临时打开、查完关掉——这本身就是一种运维开关（见<a href=\"../foundations/flag-concepts-types\">开关类型</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个开关理论 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2^n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6644em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 组合，但大多不交互：默认只测「待上线变体全开」+「当前生产态」两个点，额外只测真正交互的组合，把矩阵收缩到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2n+k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>必须测组合的是共享状态/有依赖/互斥的开关；最危险是隐式依赖被违反时走到没设计过的路径。</li>\n<li>把开关求值作为可注入依赖（用 OpenFeature 内存 provider 而非全局单例），让分支测试确定可控，呼应<a href=\"../foundations/flag-evaluation-model\">评估纯函数</a>。</li>\n<li>CI 分层跑（主流水线两套配置 + 针对性组合 + 契约测试）；开关反过来也是测试工具——合成监控指定变体、暗启动影子流量、生产调试开关，与<a href=\"../delivery/progressive-rollout\">渐进放量</a>健康度信号相连。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"带开关的测试策略","id":"带开关的测试策略"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：组合爆炸与它的边界","id":"核心概念-组合爆炸与它的边界"},{"level":2,"text":"哪些组合必须测","id":"哪些组合必须测"},{"level":2,"text":"把开关从测试里隔离","id":"把开关从测试里隔离"},{"level":2,"text":"CI 里跑哪个变体","id":"ci-里跑哪个变体"},{"level":2,"text":"开关反过来是测试工具","id":"开关反过来是测试工具"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"开关系统架构与 SDK","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/practice/flag-system-architecture"},"next":{"title":"治理、审计与可观测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/feature-flags-progressive-delivery/practice/governance-observability"}}